Track Crack Exam is a fully responsive Smart Exam Tracking web application designed to help students efficiently manage, organize, and track their exam schedules with ease. This project allows users to add, edit, update, and delete exam details while providing a structured dashboard for monitoring upcoming tests and reducing exam-related stress.
Built using HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, AJAX, PHP, and MySQL, the platform features a dynamic and interactive user interface with seamless real-time updates without page reloads. Its responsive design ensures accessibility across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices, making exam preparation more organized and efficient.
Key Features:


Add, edit, update, and delete exam schedules


Real-time updates using AJAX


Responsive design for all devices


User-friendly dashboard for exam tracking


PHP & MySQL backend for secure data management


